  "title": "给高×的信",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-071.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>071)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n高×先生：<br>\n<br>\n　　寄书寄词，还有二信，均己收到，极为感谢，高文两册，我很爱读，肃此，敬颂吉安。<br><br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br><br>\n　　一九六四年三月十八日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-070.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-072.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
